abstract: "C11 SIMD implementation with native ARM NEON and SIMDe compatibility of orthonormal 2D DCT-II and its inverse, using the attributed Shao-Johnson factorization with selected SIMD and memory organizations. Ooura is retained separately as a benchmark comparator and historical source. Original code is BSD-3-Clause; Ooura-derived sources retain their upstream permission in NOTICE.md."
